    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Janice Gilsig",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103784544909400942705/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVvu9KjlKyYXS89TG7d04jjH74Pzs58Rlk2T8kRsYxhkI1jQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "These days when dealing with contractors is a lesson in frustration due to no call backs and no shows, MPKL is a breath of fresh air. They are  the blueprint of how a service company should operate. Sandy in Administration is a pro at customer service, answering email and returning phone calls immediately. The 2 technicians who came to replace my air exchanger were top notch, professional, and answered all my questions with patience, giving me a crash course in air exchanger operation. I am so impressed with them that I wish they would branch out to other services. They would get all my business! I can't recommend them enough.",
        "time": 1763655425,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bonnie Freeman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104249734388985860747/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLvaO6T0nN0Abs7590AFY75hUbjVWGxjRCh6mMGzr8gT-qR5w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Marc is great. Been using his services for a few years now.  He is trustworthy, honest and extremely knowledgable. All employees are courteous and respectful. Sandy is extremely competent as well.",
        "time": 1757214891,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aaron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102825532658904577634/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-pGK1VkyAebmSc48Np_IoX35ZbAkD9CKbtYhcqALv2W1a2w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely amazing experience from start to finish. Felt like a very important client from the minute we started planning the HVAC conversion. No pressure and very solution oriented. Definitely recommend. Look no further !",
        "time": 1764684500,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dave Vallieres",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108536759045597737122/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKht29OxUm-73yoQFiv3fq4hKWoscW9T6-zdeXPJ3JGlZs36Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The technicians were very professional & pleasant to deal with. Our AC units are working much better since they did the maintenance. The team were extremely clean & proud of their work. I would highly recommend this company.",
        "time": 1758138442,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mélanie Girard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115822905348866934276/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKcQoPcnCjfegPAw_EHprqokCAZdzyacgqGFHSnMfr7dmPvog=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "What a wonderful experience and service I had with Les Services M.P.K.L. This is the first time I ever write a review and I really wanted to express how satisfied I was with Marc Andre Lalonde and Eric De Ladurantaye professionalism and work. My air conditioner broke down during a heat wave and the fit me in because of an unexpected opening. I was so grateful they changed my compressor and rebooted the system. It’s so nice to have work done by people that you feel you can trust and still do honest work. People like these are hard to find and would recommend these guys 100%.",
        "time": 1755113223,
        "translated": false
      }
